  "known_local_policies": [
    "Refreshing Spring Water counts only its two original successful hand/draw-cast Spell roots, after both slots and their reactions; burns, fatigue, replacement children and extra reaction draws do not add refresh rewards.",
    "Book of Specters discards only still-resident original Spell hand arrivals from its three roots, not replacement draws or extra reaction draws. All accepted spell recipients move before discard publication/reactions.",
    "Under the Sea excludes the source card identity from its physical Spell tutor. Its original pre-draw stored local cost is captured in complete material, then the completed successful hand/draw-cast root summons from the full ordinary any-class collectible minion cost domain. Empty matches and burned roots do not summon.",
    "Burn/replacement, exact cost-quote and observer boundaries are explicit local policies pending CN calibration; fixed-version/hotfix alignment and rule edges remain deferred."
  ],
